---
layout: base.njk
title: 홈
---
<section class="hero">
  <div class="wrap">
    {% if about.hero_image %}
    <img class="hero-photo" src="{{ about.hero_image }}" alt="{{ site.name_kr }}">
    {% else %}
    {% include "compass.njk" %}
    {% endif %}
    <div class="hero-eyebrow">Life &amp; Career Design School</div>
    <h1>인생이라는 항해,<br>당신의 항로를 함께 설계합니다</h1>
    <p class="lead">{{ about.mission }}</p>
    <a href="/about/" class="btn solid">스쿨 소개 보기</a>
    <a href="/programs/" class="btn">운영 과정 보기</a>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="block">
  <div class="wrap">
    <div class="section-head">
      <div class="eyebrow">Mission &amp; Vision</div>
      <h2>미션과 비전</h2>
    </div>
    <div class="grid-2">
      <div class="card">
        <span class="en">Mission</span>
        <h3>미션</h3>
        <p>&ldquo;{{ about.mission }}&rdquo;</p>
      </div>
      <div class="card">
        <span class="en">Vision</span>
        <h3>비전</h3>
        <p>&ldquo;{{ about.vision }}&rdquo;</p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="block alt">
  <div class="wrap">
    <div class="section-head">
      <div class="eyebrow">Track Record</div>
      <h2>스쿨 운영 실적</h2>
      <p>등록민간자격 과정을 통해 배출한 인원입니다.</p>
    </div>
    <div class="stats">
      <div class="stat-card">
        <div class="stat-num">13개 기수</div>
        <div class="stat-label">생애경력설계사(Life &amp; Career Designer) 1급</div>
      </div>
      <div class="stat-card">
        <div class="stat-num">6개 기수</div>
        <div class="stat-label">전직지원컨설턴트(Outplacement Consultant) 1급</div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="block cta-consult">
  <div class="wrap" style="text-align:center;">
    <div class="eyebrow">Free Consultation</div>
    <h2>무료 상담 신청</h2>
    <p style="color:var(--muted); max-width:52ch; margin:0 auto 10px;">이메일 상담과 15분 전화 상담 중 편하신 방식으로, 부담 없이 첫 걸음을 떼어보세요.</p>
    <a href="/contact/" class="btn solid">무료 상담 신청하기</a>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="block">
  <div class="wrap">
    <div class="section-head">
      <div class="eyebrow">Philosophy</div>
      <h2>대표자 철학</h2>
    </div>
    <div class="grid-3">
      {% for p in about.philosophy %}
      <div class="card">
        <span class="en">{{ p.en }}</span>
        <h3>{{ p.title }}</h3>
        <p>{{ p.desc }}</p>
      </div>
      {% endfor %}
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
